Usage: amux board request <worker> <title>
       amux board request <worker> --stdin | --file <path>

Files the card on the NAMED WORKER'S board, as a todo their dispatch offers them
at their next turn boundary, with you recorded as its requester and a callback
armed back to you. You are notified when THAT card reaches a terminal status.
That path is separate from anything a --depends-on link does (see below).

Until AMUX-4653 this created a backlog card on your OWN board with the worker as
